  Buffs: {
   ArtifactWardBuff: {
    DisplayName: Lightning Ward Guard
    Description: Damage reduction +35 percentage points and defense +12; duration controlled by skill state
   }
  }
  Skills: {
   Spiritwood: "Wood Volley"
   SpiritwoodRequirement: "Hold an awakened Spiritwood Crossbow: three aimed ranged bolts at 150% weapon damage, speed 16 and 0.12-radian spacing; base cost 18 energy, shared 20-second cooldown. Uses no arrows."
   SpiritwoodDaoRequirement: "Matching Dao world: three 200% bolts (250% for Sever). Rebuild costs 24 and heals up to 20; Sever costs 30; Star Abyss costs 20 and adds 8 pressure. Shared 20-second cooldown; player cost modifiers apply."
   Woodgrain: "Woodgrain Recall"
   WoodgrainRequirement: "Hold the awakened Woodgrain Flying Sword: three 125% melee swords with returning flight, 16 base energy and shared 20-second cooldown."
   WoodgrainDaoRequirement: "Matching Dao world: three 175% returning swords (225% for Sever). Rebuild costs 22 and heals up to 20; Sever costs 28; Star Abyss costs 18 and adds 8 pressure. Shared 20-second cooldown; player cost modifiers apply."
   Flame: "Flame Fan"
   FlameRequirement: "Hold an awakened Cinnabar Talisman Flame; three 150% magic flames, shared 20-second cooldown."
   FlameDaoRequirement: "Hold the transformed awakened Cinnabar Talisman Flame in a matching world: three 200% flames (250% for Sever); Rebuild heals up to 20, Star Abyss adds 8 pressure. Shared 20-second cooldown."
   WardTooltip: Equip in a usable accessory slot to cast guard (default V, configurable): base cost 18 spiritual energy, 3-second duration, 20-second shared cooldown
   Capacity: Not enough projectile capacity; nothing spent
   Sword: Burst
   Array: Pulse
   Moon: Moon Burst
   Wheel: Five Wheels
   WheelRequirement: Hold a crafted-awakened Formless Sword Wheel; launch five wheels at 0.3-radian intervals across the aimed fan, each dealing 150% of current weapon damage with normal wheel collision and penetration
   MoonRequirement: Hold a crafted-awakened Moonbone Dharma Sword: fire three aimed shards, each dealing 150% of current weapon damage, using the normal shard collision and penetration
   MoonDaoRequirement: "Hold a matching-route Dao-transformed Moonbone Dharma Sword: Rebuild gives three 200% shards and up to 20 self-heal; Sever gives three 250% shards; Star Abyss gives three 200% shards and adds 8 spiritual pressure; otherwise the awakened 150% skill applies"
   WheelDaoRequirement: "Hold a matching-route Dao-transformed Formless Sword Wheel: Rebuild gives five 200% wheels and up to 20 self-heal; Sever gives five 250% wheels; Star Abyss gives five 200% wheels and adds 8 spiritual pressure; otherwise the awakened 150% skill applies"
   Hammer: Triple Fall
   HammerRequirement: Reach Qi Condensation and hold a crafted-awakened Black Furnace Warhammer; throw three aimed hammers at 0.24-radian intervals and speed 9, each dealing 175% of current weapon damage with normal gravity and collision; each hammer releases at most one half-damage impact
   HammerDaoRequirement: "Reach Qi Condensation and hold a matching-route Dao-transformed Black Furnace Warhammer: Rebuild gives three 225% hammers and up to 20 self-heal; Sever gives three 275% hammers; Star Abyss gives three 225% hammers and adds 8 spiritual pressure; normal one-shot half-damage impacts remain; otherwise the awakened 175% skill applies"
   Thunder: Thunderfall
   ThunderDaoRequirement: "Hold a Thunder Pattern Sword Case transformed along the matching world route: Rebuild strikes for 200% each and heals up to 20, Sever strikes for 250%, Star Abyss strikes for 200% and adds 8 pressure; keeps the 800-pixel range and terrain checks; inactive routes restore awakened 150% strikes"
   ThunderRequirement: Hold a crafted-awakened Thunder Pattern Sword Case; call three bolts above a visible point within 800 pixels, spaced 96 pixels apart, each dealing 150% of current weapon damage; blocked spawn or fall paths spend nothing
   Ward: Guard
   PanelControls: Gold border marks selection; bind panel previous, next, cast and clear in Mod Controls for keyboard or gamepad
   CanRequest: Current prerequisites allow a cast request; aim and terrain are checked when casting
   Ready: Shared cooldown ready; hover a skill to check prerequisites; configure keys in Mod Controls
   Cooldown: "Shared skill cooldown: {0}s"
   WardStatus: "Cooldown: {0}s | Guard: {1}s"
   Unavailable: Hold the corresponding awakened artifact, or equip Lightning Ward Jade in an unlocked functional slot
   CoolingDown: Shared active skill cooldown is not ready
   NeedArray: Hold an awakened array plate and stand near your own Greenwood array
   NoHealing: No friendly player in the array needs healing; nothing spent
   NeedEnergy: Not enough spiritual energy; nothing spent
   Success: Active skill cast
  }
 }
